        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: ASIS International, American Society for Industrial Security\n- Publications: Security Management\n- People: Peter Tarlow\n- Concepts: Computer security, cyber security, IT security, event risk management, safety\n\nFacts:\n- Security Management is a monthly magazine of ASIS International, formerly called the American Society for Industrial Security.\n- Computer security, also known as cyber security or IT security, is the protection of computer systems from theft or damage to hardware, software, or information, and from disruption or misdirection of their services.\n- Peter Tarlow is the author of \"Event Risk Management and Safety.\"\n- Security Management magazine reviewed Peter Tarlow's book \"Event Risk Management and Safety\" in 2003 and 2005.",
